            "review_title": "Review at Matsuri Sushi Nha Trang",
            "review_text": "Алексей\n3 contributions\n0\nA wonderful place, we'll come back again!\nOct 2026 • Friends\nVery pleased with the visit to \"Matsuri\"! We ordered a set of rolls, tom-yam, and baked sushi. All products are exclusively fresh, the fish is tender, and the portions are truly generous—they didn't skimp on the fillings. I would like to separately mention the presentation: everything looks very aesthetic and appetizing. The staff is polite, the order was brought quickly, despite the full house. The atmosphere in the establishment is pleasant and cozy. We will definitely come back again and recommend to friends!\nRead more\nTranslated from Russian\nShow original\nWritten October 2, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
